      "title": "Prince and Princess of Wales join Royal Ascot racegoers",
      "summary": "Prince and princess join Royal Ascot racegoersPA MediaThe Prince and Princess of Wales attended the second day of Royal AscotThousands of people enjoyed the second day of Royal Ascot.One of the highlights of the summer social calendar, it is taking place over five days at the Berkshire Ascot Racecourse.PA MediaCatherine, Princess of Wales, was pictured laughing with other guest…",
      "body": "Prince and princess join Royal Ascot racegoersPA MediaThe Prince and Princess of Wales attended the second day of Royal AscotThousands of people enjoyed the second day of Royal Ascot.One of the highlights of the summer social calendar, it is taking place over five days at the Berkshire Ascot Racecourse.PA MediaCatherine, Princess of Wales, was pictured laughing with other guests at the eventPA MediaMany elaborate designs of headwear were on display on the festival's second day.PA MediaAbout 290,000 people are expected to attend Royal Ascot this week.ReutersThis pair of racegoers were pictured enjoying their lunch ahead of the day's racing.PA MediaRoyal Ascot is set to run until Saturday.ReutersThis racegoer was pictured looking after their car ahead of Tuesday's showcase getting under way.",
