      "body": "5035 independent, personal blogs. One front page. Ranked by votes and freshness, shaped by you.\nthe girly wellness aesthetic as a white supremacist dog whistle\n7 hours ago · Writing · 0 comments\nFileZilla is still awesome after 24 years\n7 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nNo regrets switching to Linux\n1 hour ago · Tech · 0 comments\nI wanted Bear Blog, but for my photos\n1 day ago · Life · 14 comments\nCaps lock is useless and I wish I could remove it\n11 hours ago · Tech · 4 comments\n9 hours ago · Life · 1 comment\n1 day ago · Tech · 1 comment\n5 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\n21 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\n(Ahmad Rosid - Software Engineer)\n2 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nMBook -- a proposal for a new, simple e-book format based on Markdown\n2 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nAppreciation for the small web\n2 days ago · Tech · 0 comments\nNobody clicks your share buttons\n2 days ago · Tech · 2 comments\niCloud’s ‘Hide My Email’ Feature Becomes Easier to Block\n3 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nFour Gun Salute Going To The Office\n3 hours ago · Life · 0 comments\nWhy Yes, I'll Buy You a Coffee\n(The Art Of Not Asking Why)\n20 hours ago · Life · 0 comments\nRun a local coding model with pi and LM Studio\n2 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nApple’s New Hide My Email Domain Makes It Easier to Block iCloud Aliases\n1 hour ago · Tech · 1 comment\nAGI Happened on January 16, 2026\n2 hours ago · Tech · 0 comments\nTwo days of Town Square\n2 days ago · Life · 7 comments\nDear Pinboard, I'm breaking up with you. It's me and it's you.\n1 day ago · Tech · 0 comments\nheres your better post title!!!!!\n1 day ago · Writing · 1 comment\nBloggers, can we make better titles for our posts?\n2 days ago · Life · 1 comment\nA New Tool for Curbing AI Cheating (guest post)\n3 hours ago · Culture · 0 comments\n1 day ago · Life · 0 comments\n8 hours ago · Writing · 1 comment\n8 hours ago · Crafts · 0 comments\nLike: “Wait. You knew it was damaging mental health, sleep, attention and social development, and your response was… ...\n(John's World Wide Wall Display)\n5 hours ago · Life · 0 comments\nAnnouncing folk.zone: An attempt to build the IndieWeb commons myself.\n1 day ago · Tech · 0 comments\nLEGO Delivers A…Working Pinball Machine!?\n5 hours ago · Gaming · 0 comments",
