e will do anything to protectDating Apps: The Inside StorySeduced or snared by the swipe? Digital dating's big business, but what's the human cost?57 minsJamali Maddix: Follow The LeaderWho’s really in charge? Inside the power, influence and devotion of extreme subculturesEye InvestigationsAfrica Eye investigates Johannesburg’s hijacked buildings, before the city’s G20 summit.27 minsDoorbell DetectivesMatt Allwright meets the Doorbell Detectives fighting crime with doorbell cameras.29 minsKiller Couple: Love on TrialLove, violence and a verdict under scrutiny. Re-examining evidence behind a tragic murder38 minsThe Elon Musk ShowElon Musk’s rise from geeky tech entrepreneur to making millions.Policing ParadiseKeep palm and carry on with Bermuda's island-hopping, crime-stopping police forceNatalie Cassidy: Caring TogetherNew place. New role. Natalie swaps the Square for her first steps into becoming a carerCarl Frampton - On ProbationGetting offenders back on the straight and narrow. The champion boxer explores the fight",
