      "summary": "Article URL: https://status.claude.com/incidents/xmhsglsz3h3w\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48558766\nPoints: 106\n# Comments: 74",
      "body": "We are continuing to work on a fix for this issue.\nPosted Jun 16, 2026 - 19:08 UTC\nWe are continuing to work to resolve an elevated rate of errors on requests to Claude Opus 4.8, and will provide an additional update as soon as possible.\nPosted Jun 16, 2026 - 19:00 UTC\nWe are still seeing errors on Opus 4.8 and Haiku 4.5.\nPosted Jun 16, 2026 - 18:15 UTC\nA fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.\nPosted Jun 16, 2026 - 18:00 UTC\nWe are currently investigating this issue.\nPosted Jun 16, 2026 - 17:29 UTC\nThis incident affects: claude.ai, Claude API (api.anthropic.com), Claude Code, and Claude Cowork.",
