      "author": "Brad Bourque",
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-16T16:31:40.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/06/primedayFAQ.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.721349621873,100,78.557300756254",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/945942/prime-day-2026-frequently-asked-questions",
