      "body": "Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food         Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live             Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food        Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live         Close menu\nFIFA World CupA-ZTV GuideWatchlistHomePM Announces Social Media Ban for Under-16sPM Announces Social Media Ban for Under-16sSnapchat, TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and X are among the platforms affected - but not WhatsApp or Signal, the government says. Duration9 minsFirst shown15 Jun 2026Expires tonight 12:59amAudio DescribedSign LanguageMore Like ThisMore Like This EpisodesReport Reveals Shocking 'Bycatch' Toll on Marine LifeDolphins and seals among marine wildlife inadvertently killed by fishing vessels annuallyManchester City Homecoming ParadeThe Citizens celebrate winning trophies including the FA Cup and Carabao CupIran War Today: Monday's DevelopmentsTrump says a deal to end the Iran war has been signed with details released 'pretty soon'Arrest Made After Seizure of Russian Tanker in ChannelNational Crime Agency officers detain Indian national on suspicion of sanctions offencesRos Atkins on Costs and Challenges of Hosting World CupThe tournament faces questions around heat, cost, travel and the environmentRussia Behind Arson Attacks Targeting PM, BBC RevealsA 22-year-old Ukrainian builder was weaponised to target the UK's head of governmentWatch live results from Jersey’s General Election as they’re declared, with Matthew Price.Social Media Regulation: What Happens Next?The PM's vowed to take 'decisive' action to tackle the impact of social media on childrenThe Dawn Sturgess Inquiry: A Points West SpecialWatch live from Salisbury after report into Dawn Sturgess' death is released.Elon Musk's SpaceX Makes $2 Trillion Stock Market DebutThe rocket firm is the highest-valued new stock listing in historyMakerfield By-Election Candidates Live DebateMakerfield by-election candidates debate cost of living, energy and immigrationTeacher Guilty of Sexually Abusing and Murdering Adopted Baby...13-month-old Preston Davey died at the hands of Jamie Varley 4 months after adopting him",
