      "id": "hackernews-2026-06-12-show-hn-stackscope-i-crawled-over-40k-indie-launches-to-see-",
      "title": "Show HN: StackScope – I crawled over 40k indie launches to see what they ship",
      "summary": "Hey all, I built StackScope, a crawler/catalogue that looks at new product launches and shows what they were built with.\nIt watches launches from Product Hunt, Show HN, and PeerPush, then crawls the public site behind each one. The goal is to show what people actually launched with: hosting, frameworks, analytics, DNS, security headers, legal pages, AI-builder signals, and other public clues.\nI st",
      "body": "We analyse new product launches and show you what's under the hood.\nDaily analysis of early-stage launches from Product Hunt, Hacker News, and PeerPush. Tech stacks, AI signals, security headers, hosting, domains, and delivery infrastructure.\n41,812 launches analysed · Check your own site →\nshow strong AI generation patterns\nTurn product data into actionable insights\nTurn long videos into viral clips using automated AI tools.\nFree AI Directory Listing Generator\nGenerate authentic warrior cat names using clan traditions\nAI-powered income and expense tracking without spreadsheets\nTurn every tap into feedback, rewards, and happy guests\nGenerate optimized AI prompts for ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini\nIndian Startup Revenue & Profit\nAccess audited FY2025 financial data for Indian startups",
