      "author": "Antonio G. Di Benedetto",
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-10T23:12:51.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/06/DSC00210_71b030.webp?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,16.22192197264,100,67.55615605472",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/948044/framework-laptop-13-pro-delay-shipment-july-august",
