    {
      "id": "techcrunch-2026-06-10-wing-drone-delivery-might-not-be-a-novelty-anymore",
      "title": "Wing drone delivery might not be a novelty anymore",
      "summary": "Wing is expanding into seven more U.S. cities through its partnership with Walmart.",
      "body": "12:52 PM PDT · June 10, 2026\nImage Credits:Ethan Good/AP Content Services for Wing Drone Delivery\nWing, the Alphabet-owned company that delivers groceries and even coffee using autonomous drones, is pushing into seven more U.S. cities through its partnership with Walmart.\nThe expansion is part of a broader plan to build a drone-delivery network of more than 270 Walmart locations by next year. The new markets include Memphis, New Orleans, Philadelphia, Phoenix, San Diego, the San Francisco Bay Area, and Salt Lake City, bringing Wing and Walmart’s total service footprint to nearly 20 U.S. markets.\nWing is already delivering Walmart goods to customers in Atlanta, Dallas-Fort Worth, and Greater Houston. The company has announced plans to expand to Orlando, Tampa, Charlotte, St. Louis, Cincinnati, Los Angeles, and Miami as well.\nWalmart has experimented with drone delivery for years. But after successful deployments with Wing in Dallas-Fort Worth and Atlanta, it upsized its commitment. In January, the companies announced plans to bring the on-demand drone-delivery service to an additional 150 Walmart stores.\nThe upshot: Consumers are using drone delivery more than you might think. Wing has completed more than 1 million commercial deliveries through its partnership with Walmart.\nWing’s chief business officer, Heather Rivera, told TechCrunch back in January that its top 25% of customers use the service three times a week.\n“Our work with Walmart has shown that drone delivery isn’t just a novelty, it’s a service many customers count on multiple times per week,” Rivera said in a statement announcing the new markets.\nSubscribe for the industry’s biggest tech news",
      "source": "TechCrunch",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "Kirsten Korosec",
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-10T19:52:09.000Z",
